  "problem": "Reviewers could be asked to approve an unspecified whole dataset. Accepting one field could silently accept others. Identical evidence grouping could merge separate source identities. Stale approvals could survive revised source bytes. Pending proposals could be described as public facts. Editing sealed identity sources broke the WP7 artifact seal.",
  "resulting_behavior": "Claim-review packets live in packages/enrichment/review-packet.mjs. A reviewer can accept one field while leaving others unresolved. Packet hashes bind reviewed values. Identical evidence is grouped without merging source identities. Dispositions are accept, reject, request evidence and supersede. Revised source bytes invalidate stale decisions. Pending proposals are never public facts. Whole-dataset approval is forbidden. Sealed packages/identity/src/review-queue.mjs remains 3033 bytes / 86196f3e\u2026 and schema-catalog.mjs remains 16653 bytes. WP7 identity artifact seal validates.",
